Flight F24 (Omar, day 2) arrival was shifted from 19:15 to 21:00 on September 21, 2026, as an intervention with no fee
Flight F25 (Omar, day 1) arrival was shifted from 11:45 to 13:45 on September 21, 2026, as an intervention with no fee
Reservation T67 pickup was automatically shifted from 13:15 to 18:45 on September 21, 2026, following the F80 arrival change
Reservation T57 pickup was automatically shifted from 12:05 to 14:45 on September 21, 2026, following the F25 arrival change
Reservation T29 pickup was automatically shifted from 20:10 to 22:00 on September 21, 2026, following the F24 arrival change
Reservation S37 check-in was shifted from 21:00 to 22:50 on September 21, 2026, with a fee of 25 and marked as late arrival
Reservation D58 start time was shifted from 22:45 to 23:45 on September 21, 2026, with a fee of 25

